{
  "name": "PATH HW1 REAL - AI Agent Team and Tools",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HW1: Real AI Agent team\n\nLearning objective:\nBuild a real multi-agent workflow in n8n using AI Agent nodes, model nodes, and tool nodes.\n\nTask:\nCreate a weekly \"AI Study Digest\" for community college students.\n\nRequired:\n- Researcher Agent with a search-like tool\n- Writer Agent\n- Critic Agent\n- Revision Agent\n- deterministic IF route\n\nCode nodes are only prompt builders / parsers. They are not agents.\n\nBefore running:\nAdd your OpenAI credential to each Chat Model node.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-brief",
      "name": "Assignment Brief",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1040,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What students must show\n\nComplete:\n- At least 3 AI Agent nodes\n- Each agent has a Chat Model\n- Researcher has at least one tool\n- Critic output routes approve vs revise\n\nReflection:\n- What does each agent do?\n- Which tool belongs to which agent?\n- Which nodes are deterministic and why?",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-rubric",
      "name": "Rubric",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "hw1-real-manual",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1000,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "hw1-real-config-field-0",
              "name": "topic",
              "value": "AI tools and study strategies useful for community college students",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "hw1-real-config-field-1",
              "name": "audience",
              "value": "students new to AI agents",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "hw1-real-config-field-2",
              "name": "digest_length",
              "value": "250 words",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "hw1-real-config-field-3",
              "name": "chatInput",
              "value": "Research 3 practical AI study tools or strategies for community college students. Return concise bullet points with benefits, cautions, and suggested use.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-config",
      "name": "Assignment Config - edit me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -760,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the Researcher Agent. Use your tools when useful. Return structured notes with: finding, why it matters, caution, and source/tool used. Do not write the final digest."
        }
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-researcher",
      "name": "Researcher Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -500,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-research-model",
      "name": "Chat Model - Researcher",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -520,
        370
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "hw1-real-wiki",
      "name": "Wikipedia Tool - Researcher",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWikipedia",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        370
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "hw1-real-research-think",
      "name": "Think Tool - Researcher",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolThink",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        370
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const research = $input.first().json.output || JSON.stringify($input.first().json);\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    research,\n    chatInput: [\n      \"Use the research notes below to write a student-facing AI Study Digest.\",\n      \"Audience: community college students new to AI agents.\",\n      \"Requirements: plain language, 3 useful items, one caution section, no fake citations.\",\n      \"\",\n      research\n    ].join(\"\\n\")\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-writer-prompt",
      "name": "Build Writer Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the Writer Agent. Your only job is to turn research notes into a clear digest. Do not invent new facts. Keep the tone encouraging and concrete."
        }
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-writer",
      "name": "Writer Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        20,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-writer-model",
      "name": "Chat Model - Writer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        370
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "hw1-real-writer-think",
      "name": "Think Tool - Writer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolThink",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        370
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const draft = $input.first().json.output || JSON.stringify($input.first().json);\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    draft,\n    chatInput: [\n      \"Review this draft using the rubric.\",\n      \"Rubric: useful to students, clear role separation, no fake sources, includes cautions, about 250 words.\",\n      \"Start your response with exactly APPROVE or REVISE.\",\n      \"If REVISE, list specific fixes.\",\n      \"\",\n      draft\n    ].join(\"\\n\")\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-critic-prompt",
      "name": "Build Critic Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        280,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the Critic Agent. You do not rewrite the digest unless asked. Judge quality using the rubric. Start with APPROVE or REVISE."
        }
      },
      "id": "hw1-real-critic",
      "name": "Critic Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
